183
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:53,760
Okay, so now let's take a look at our next word in putting it together.

184
00:07:53,760 --> 00:07:54,660
Did you happen to...

185
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:56,020
Did you happen to...

186
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,620
Did you happen to...

187
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,280
Did you happen to...

188
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:01,000
Did you happen to see Bob this morning?

189
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:03,100
I didn't happen to see Bob.

190
00:08:04,140 --> 00:08:04,720
So it means like...

191
00:08:05,100 --> 00:08:06,440
Like, did you by chance...

192
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:09,380
By chance, did you by chance see Bob or something.

193
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:10,840
Yeah.

194
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:14,580
Another example would be, did you happen to go to that restaurant I recommended?

195
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,120
Or maybe, do you happen to have a pen?

196
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:20,940
Do you happen to know where the bathroom is?

197
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:22,690
Yeah, that's a really useful one.

198
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:23,610
That's a good useful one.

199
00:08:23,890 --> 00:08:25,730
That's basically how you would use this structure.

200
00:08:26,230 --> 00:08:27,230
Did you happen to...

201
00:08:27,490 --> 00:08:28,350
Do you happen to...

202
00:08:28,690 --> 00:08:34,490
